# Shell scripts must always use LF line endings, regardless of a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. A CRLF-corrupted shebang
# (e.g. "#!/bin/bash\r") makes the script fail to exec with
# "cannot execute: required file not found" -- this bit us in
# terraform/terraform-modules/cognito-auth/lambda/build-lambda.sh.
*.sh text eol=lf
